        <Title>Add identity domain and SQLite credential storage</Title>
        <DependsOn></DependsOn>
        <AcceptanceCriteria>
          <Criterion>Add identity and credential domain types with string IDs and a Dropbox provider enum, plus repository interfaces for identity and credentials.</Criterion>
